<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1951952113"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1624476862"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="愛言葉IV"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="DECO*27 / 初音ミク"/><amll:meta key="album" value="愛言葉IV"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:38.880"><div begin="00:20.780" end="03:28.090"><p begin="00:20.780" end="00:25.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">想像なんてしてなかった現状<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是从未想象过的现状</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u zo u na n te shi te na ka 't ta ge n jo u</span></p><p begin="00:25.490" end="00:27.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">君もそう思った?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否也是如此认为呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi mo so u o mo 't ta ？</span></p><p begin="00:27.670" end="00:31.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">"最高"で止まらないように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了不止于“最棒”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ sa i ko u ” de to ma ra na i yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:31.170" end="00:33.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">更新したい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要继续将记录更新下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko u shi n shi ta i</span></p><p begin="00:33.860" end="00:37.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">叶えたい夢まであとどれくらい?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">距离想实现的梦想还有多远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na e ta i yu me ma de a to do re ku ra i ？</span></p><p begin="00:37.370" end="00:40.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">誰も行ったことがない場所へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔赴还未有人踏足的地方吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re mo i 't ta ko to ga na i ba sho he</span></p><p begin="00:40.820" end="00:44.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">たどり着くまでは"僕ら止まれない"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在抵达之前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta do ri tsu ku ma de wa</span></p><p begin="00:44.310" end="00:46.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">たぶんしんどいけど、<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许未来的路会很辛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta bu n shi n do i ke do</span></p><p begin="00:46.380" end="00:48.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">どうかよろしくね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但还是请你多多指教呀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka yo ro shi ku ne</span></p><p begin="00:48.400" end="00:49.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">ねえねえ たまにメーデー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐呐 偶尔发出求救信号</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e ne e ta ma ni me e de e</span></p><p begin="00:49.910" end="00:51.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">僕だけじゃ作れないモノ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">单凭我一人无法创造的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku da ke ja tsu ku re na i mo no</span></p><p begin="00:51.640" end="00:53.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">僕とか君とかあたしとか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或是我 或是你 又或是我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku to ka ki mi to ka a ta shi to ka</span></p><p begin="00:53.280" end="00:55.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">恋とか愛とかまとめて全部<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或是恋 或是爱 将那一切一并带上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko i to ka a i to ka ma to me te ze n bu</span></p><p begin="00:55.500" end="00:59.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">君を置いてどっかに行っちゃうとか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我绝对不会</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wo o i te</span></p><p begin="00:59.160" end="01:01.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">ありえないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">独自离去的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ri e na i yo</span></p><p begin="01:01.500" end="01:05.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">君がくれた音に 弾けた火花に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你赋予我的声音 迸溅开来的火花</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga ku re ta o to ni ha ji ke ta hi ba na ni</span></p><p begin="01:05.000" end="01:06.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">初めましてから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从初次见面起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ji me ma shi te ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:06.730" end="01:08.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">ずっと恋しちゃってるんだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便让我深爱不已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to ko i shi cha 't te ru n da yo</span></p><p begin="01:08.880" end="01:12.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">君のいない未来考えらんないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经无法想象没有你的未来了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no i na i mi ra i ka n ga e ra n na i yo</span></p><p begin="01:12.690" end="01:15.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">これから先も二人がいいじゃん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今后也让我们两人一同携手前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko re ka ra sa ki mo fu ta ri ga i i ja n</span></p><p begin="01:15.310" end="01:17.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">一途になるほど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾因对你的情有独钟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi zu ni na ru ho do</span></p><p begin="01:17.080" end="01:18.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">逃げたくもなったよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而萌生了逃开的念头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ge ta ku mo na 't ta yo</span></p><p begin="01:18.840" end="01:20.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">散々な僕のこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样狼狈不堪的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n za n na bo ku no ko to</span></p><p begin="01:20.500" end="01:22.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">呼んでくれてありがとう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谢谢你呼唤了我的姓名</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo n de ku re te a ri ga to u</span></p><p begin="01:22.720" end="01:26.510" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">君のいない未来考えらんないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经无法想象没有你的未来了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no i na i mi ra i ka n ga e ra n na i yo</span></p><p begin="01:26.510" end="01:27.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">これから先も二人で、<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今后也让我们两人一同携手前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko re ka ra sa ki mo fu ta ri de</span></p><p begin="01:27.860" end="01:33.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">それがいいじゃん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要这样就好了吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re ga i i ja n</span></p><p begin="01:33.300" end="01:36.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">妄想 膨らんでくストーリー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">妄想 我们的故事不断膨胀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u so u fu ku ra n de ku su to o ri i</span></p><p begin="01:36.730" end="01:40.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">感傷 やけに凹んじゃって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感伤 却反而令人失落沮丧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n sho u ya ke ni he ko n ja 't te</span></p><p begin="01:40.210" end="01:43.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">代償 求め過ぎはやーよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">代价 我不喜欢太强人所难</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i sho u mo to me su gi wa ya a yo</span></p><p begin="01:43.640" end="01:47.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">終わんない愛の連盟、どうでしょ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这永不终结的爱的联盟 你觉得如何呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o wa n na i a i no re n me i do u de sho ？</span></p><p begin="01:47.130" end="01:48.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">ねえねえ おいでメーデー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐呐 到这里来吧求救讯号</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e ne e o i de me e de e</span></p><p begin="01:48.570" end="01:50.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">僕が君にできること<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我可以为你做到的事情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ga ki mi ni de ki ru ko to</span></p><p begin="01:50.580" end="01:51.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">まだまだまだまだあるけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">应该还有很多很多很多</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da ma da ma da ma da a ru ke do</span></p><p begin="01:51.930" end="01:54.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">驚かせたいから内緒なんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要给你惊喜所以还是暂且保密好了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o do ro ka se ta i ka ra na i sho na n da</span></p><p begin="01:54.210" end="01:57.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">君の愛がいつも勝っちゃうこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我才不允许</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no a i ga i tsu mo ka 'c cha u ko to</span></p><p begin="01:57.910" end="02:03.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">許さないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你所付出的爱总是比我更多</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ru sa na i yo</span></p><p begin="02:14.440" end="02:21.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">君以外はヤダ 我儘はタダ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经非你不可了 反正任性是无偿的嘛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi i ga i wa ya da wa ga ma ma wa ta da</span></p><p begin="02:21.360" end="02:24.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">変わらないトキメキを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不禁想要为这份不变的心动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ra na i to ki me ki wo</span></p><p begin="02:24.580" end="02:29.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">絶叫しちゃうのはバカ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">出声呼喊 真的就像个傻瓜一样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze 'k kyo u shi cha u no wa ba ka</span></p><p begin="02:29.610" end="02:33.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">君がくれた音に 弾けた火花に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你赋予我的声音 迸溅开来的火花</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga ku re ta o to ni ha ji ke ta hi ba na ni</span></p><p begin="02:33.050" end="02:34.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">初めましてから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从初次见面起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ji me ma shi te ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:34.750" end="02:36.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">ずっと恋しちゃってるんだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便让我深爱不已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to ko i shi cha 't te ru n da yo</span></p><p begin="02:36.940" end="02:40.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">君のいない未来考えらんないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经无法想象没有你的未来了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no i na i mi ra i ka n ga e ra n na i yo</span></p><p begin="02:40.760" end="02:43.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">これから先も二人がいいじゃん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今后也让我们两人一同携手前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko re ka ra sa ki mo fu ta ri ga i i ja n</span></p><p begin="02:43.400" end="02:45.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">一途になるほど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾因对你的情有独钟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi zu ni na ru ho do</span></p><p begin="02:45.160" end="02:46.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">逃げたくもなったよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而萌生了逃开的念头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ge ta ku mo na 't ta yo</span></p><p begin="02:46.840" end="02:48.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">散々な僕のこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样狼狈不堪的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n za n na bo ku no ko to</span></p><p begin="02:48.570" end="02:50.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">呼んでくれてありがとう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谢谢你呼唤了我的姓名</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo n de ku re te a ri ga to u</span></p><p begin="02:50.770" end="02:54.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">君のいない未来考えらんないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经无法想象没有你的未来了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no i na i mi ra i ka n ga e ra n na i yo</span></p><p begin="02:54.580" end="02:55.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">これから先も二人で、<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今后也让我们两人一同携手前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko re ka ra sa ki mo fu ta ri de</span></p><p begin="02:55.910" end="02:57.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">それがいいじゃん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要这样就好了吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re ga i i ja n</span></p><p begin="02:57.230" end="03:00.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">乙女解剖で遊ぼうよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起来玩少女解剖吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re ga i i ja n</span></p><p begin="03:00.210" end="03:03.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">ドキドキしたいじゃんか誰だって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论谁都想体验心跳加速的感觉吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ki do ki shi ta i ja n ka da re da 't te</span></p><p begin="03:03.740" end="03:05.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">アンドロイドガール<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人型机械少女</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a n do ro i do ga a ru wo</span></p><p begin="03:05.370" end="03:07.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">をかしくなっちゃった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">变得奇怪了起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka shi ku na 'c cha 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:07.560" end="03:10.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">痛みのないキスが離れない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无痛之吻在脑海挥之不去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ta mi no na i ki su ga ha na re na i</span></p><p begin="03:10.580" end="03:13.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">僕らヴァンパイア いいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们是吸血鬼 可以哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra va n pa i a i i yo</span></p><p begin="03:13.130" end="03:14.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">吸っちゃっていいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可以吸我的血哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su 'c cha 't te i i yo</span></p><p begin="03:14.910" end="03:15.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">「もう無理もう無理」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“要不行了 要不行了”如此哭喊着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 mo u mu ri mo u mu ri 」 da 't te</span></p><p begin="03:15.970" end="03:17.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">だって 悪い子じゃない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毕竟我不是坏孩子嘛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 mo u mu ri mo u mu ri 」 da 't te</span></p><p begin="03:17.320" end="03:21.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">こんな歌歌ったんだって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但其实并不是坏孩子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ru i ko ja na i</span></p><p begin="03:21.110" end="03:28.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">君が輝けるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿你能永远绽放光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga ka ga ya ke ru yo u ni</span></p></div></body></tt>